{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:512ab3c6b9869577","name":"Education","source":{"id":"source:reference-512ab3c6b9869577","title":"Education","revision":18135,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:38:45Z","sha256":"e1b39e980cef430b28bdcb5fc48acd11e3b8c9e1c4e65fd865e08282dea2948a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18135","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Education&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-512ab3c6b9869577","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," is to train or educate another being or group of beings in some way. In some cases, this could mean taking a young Padawan learner and molding them into an eventual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Master"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Master","referenceId":"reference:5fac760c8a2485ba"},", or it could mean training fresh-faced Rebel Alliance recruits and molding them into a crack team of SpecForce operatives. Characters with this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," are not merely teachers providing mundane training. The Education that this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," demands must be of great importance to the galaxy, and should lay the groundwork for the beneficiaries of your tutelage to go on to fulfill destinies of their own. Only when the training is complete can this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," be fulfilled, and the process should take many months or years to complete.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Examples of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," include Obi-Wan Kenobi's training of Anakin Skywalker, Yoda's training of Luke Skywalker, or Grand Admiral Thrawn's training of Captain Pellaeon. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," might train a new Padawan to help rebuild the shattered Jedi Order. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," might recruit elite personnel for the Galactic Alliance Fleet.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Bonus:"]}," For 24 hours, you and any allies within 10 squares of you gain a +1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Checks"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Penalty:"]}," You take a -2 penalty on all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Checks"}," for 24 hours."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Destiny Fulfilled:"]}," You gain a permanent +5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny","referenceId":"reference:373d368333d789ee"}," bonus on checks made with one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class_Skill"}," of your choice."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
